  "name": "Homefried Potatoes with Garlic and Bacon",
  "subtitle": "Crisp-edged potatoes with savory bacon and onion",
  "description": "A simple skillet breakfast of thin-sliced russet potatoes, bacon, onion, and garlic pepper seasoning.",
  "meal_type": "breakfast",
